   "help": "Handbook balanced design: force R5 = R6 = R7 = R8 and C2 = C3 (equal integrators, one matched R array, one C value). Uncheck to free R5/R6 and C2/C3 for a tighter E-series fit — the matched pair R7 = R8 still holds, so GBWP independence and low sensitivity are preserved.",
